OL,3,GNEWSACrowds welcome Karl Bushby home
OL,4,Aafter 28-year global trek
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe crossed the Humber Bridge on Sunday
OL,7,Fand was 'overwhelmed' with the
OL,8,Freception
OL,10,FThe expedition has been mainly
OL,11,Fself-funded. However, sponsors have
OL,12,Fjoined along the way, including a
OL,13,FUS-based documentary firm.
OL,15,FKarl has been sent a letter of
OL,16,Fcongratulations from Prime Minister
OL,17,FAndy Burnham, who has praised his
OL,18,Fdetermination and self belief
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
